    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751670/extras/92e8cdccf1e4f3a8d08ff91d3102306e.avif?t=1705391607\" width=620 height=148 /></span><br>Welcome to the world of Sacrament, where an exciting story-driven cooperative adventure awaits you, immersing you in the legends of the Yakut epic.<br><br>You will have to go through three unique worlds connected by the ancient Aal-Luuk-Mas tree. In the role of a young hunter and a young girl, players will join forces to go through the trials of the lower, middle and upper worlds.<br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>An original world:</strong> Immerse yourself in the atmosphere of Yakut folklore, exploring the mysterious locations of each of the three worlds.<br></li><li><strong>An epic journey:</strong> Follow the heroes on their difficult journey full of dangers and discoveries.<br></li><li><strong>Cooperative experience:</strong> Complete the game with a friend or go on a solo adventure with an artificial intelligence companion.<br></li><li><strong>Mystical Challenges:</strong> Solve puzzles, overcome obstacles and face the forces of darkness together with your allies.</li></ul><br>Subscribe and add the game to your wish list to follow the development of Sacrament!",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751670/extras/92e8cdccf1e4f3a8d08ff91d3102306e.avif?t=1705391607\" width=620 height=148 /></span><br>Welcome to the world of Sacrament, where an exciting story-driven cooperative adventure awaits you, immersing you in the legends of the Yakut epic.<br><br>You will have to go through three unique worlds connected by the ancient Aal-Luuk-Mas tree. In the role of a young hunter and a young girl, players will join forces to go through the trials of the lower, middle and upper worlds.<br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>An original world:</strong> Immerse yourself in the atmosphere of Yakut folklore, exploring the mysterious locations of each of the three worlds.<br></li><li><strong>An epic journey:</strong> Follow the heroes on their difficult journey full of dangers and discoveries.<br></li><li><strong>Cooperative experience:</strong> Complete the game with a friend or go on a solo adventure with an artificial intelligence companion.<br></li><li><strong>Mystical Challenges:</strong> Solve puzzles, overcome obstacles and face the forces of darkness together with your allies.</li></ul><br>Subscribe and add the game to your wish list to follow the development of Sacrament!",
